  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity building for prevention and mitigation of impact of HIV and AIDS in Karamoja through food and nutrition security</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. To scale up coverage, utilization and access to quality SRH, HIV prevention, treatment, care and support services for adolescents and young people (10-24 years) in Karamoja sub-region over the period 2016-2020 
2. To address socio-cultural and economic barriers that hinder HIV preventive behaviours and constrain timely access to sexual reproductive health, HIV prevention, treatment and care services among adolescents and youth 10-24 years 
3. To strengthen national and Karamoja sub- region?s capacity for planning, coordination, sustainable Financing and information systems for tracking programs</narrative>
  </description>
